CORE
main.sh
--shell-max-arguments 2
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-argument-count\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
^\[assertion\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
^\[shell-unsupported\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
--
Pathname expansion in lists of fields: each pathname matches the pattern
as a case pattern, and quoted pattern characters are matched literally.
The number of pathnames is not bounded, which shell-argument-count
reports.
